#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "- `copy_web_list_formatted()`: Copies web lists (`<ul>`, `<nav>`, "
#~ "`<select>`) as an HTML table with reliable object-tree traversal. Solves "
#~ "the issue where native Ctrl+C fails in Chrome for navigation lists.\n"
#~ "- Secondary search for list objects in `script_tableMenu` using `focus` "
#~ "object, enabling detection of open `<select>` dropdowns where the caret-"
#~ "based `NVDAObjectAtStart` does not reach.\n"
#~ "- **`perform_marked_copy_manual`**: Now uses `self.marked_rows` directly "
#~ "instead of re-collecting all rows and filtering by identity. Fixes "
#~ "missing rows on dynamic pages (e.g., Tureng) where object identity "
#~ "differs between marking and copying.\n"
#~ "- **`copy_web_list_plain`**: Replaced recursive `collect()` with direct "
#~ "child iteration to avoid recursion limit errors on very large lists "
#~ "(1200+ items). Added IAccessible `accChild` fallback for display:none "
#~ "lists (IA2_STATE_OPAQUE).\n"
#~ "- **`on_menu_select` (item_id == 1)**: For `LIST`-role objects, now calls "
#~ "`copy_web_list_formatted` instead of `perform_native_copy`. This ensures "
#~ "formatting and reliability for web navigation lists.\n"
#~ "- **`script_tableMenu` (web context)**: Now also searches `focus` object "
#~ "for `LIST` role when caret-based search fails, improving dropdown list "
#~ "detection.\n"
#~ "- Marked rows copy now correctly copies all user-selected rows on "
#~ "dynamically updated tables (object identity mismatch resolved).\n"
#~ "- Potential recursion crash when copying extremely long web lists (e.g., "
#~ "1233 items) – fixed by eliminating recursion in `copy_web_list_plain`.\n"
#~ "- Web lists with `display:none` (e.g., hidden `<select>` options) now "
#~ "copy correctly via IAccessible fallback.\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "- `copy_web_list_formatted()`: Web listelerini (`<ul>`, `<nav>`, "
#~ "`<select>`) güvenilir nesne ağacı taraması ile HTML tablosu olarak "
#~ "kopyalar. Chrome'da gezinme listelerinde yerel Ctrl+C'nin çalışmaması "
#~ "sorununu çözer.\n"
#~ "- `script_tableMenu` içinde `focus` nesnesi kullanılarak liste nesneleri "
#~ "için ikincil arama eklendi. Bu sayede, bakım tabanlı "
#~ "`NVDAObjectAtStart`'ın erişemediği açık `<select>` açılır listelerinin "
